==Appearance==
Pebble is a small pet rock [[Toon]] that has a faceted model with smoothed-out sides, underbelly, and back. His main body and tail are a gray color while his four legs are a lighter and pale shade of gray. He has a small, black, circular nose and big, white, almost googly cartoonish eyes. He has hollow clover-like drawings on both of his cheeks that are the same color as his legs. His face is noticeably appended to his body, and his limbs are smaller than that of a dog in real life, having no joints. His tail is hexagon-shaped,  and he is noticeably lacking limbs compared to his Twisted counterpart, not having a neck nor legs and also missing his counterpart's paws and claws. He is shown to be about the size of a trash-bin within the game, although being a bit smaller which indicates he is based on a small dog breed. 

==Personality==
Pebble is dog-coded, affectionate and playful towards most [[Toons]]. He also seems to show concern for his owner {{CI|Dandy|name=true}}, according to one of his interactions with {{CI|Astro|name=true}}. He obviously cannot speak English but seems to be able to comprehend it. He also seems to have a somewhat short temper, as he often growls and barks loudly at Toons. However, Astro, {{CI|Gigi|name=true}}, {{CI|Shelly|name=true}} and {{CI|Vee|name=true}}'s dialogues with Pebble suggest his barks function as a substitute for words and can convey meaning {{Small|(though knowing Vee, she might've been being sarcastic)}}. This is also suggested with his friend, {{CI|Coal|name=true}}, who seemingly has a conversation with him through mutual barks.

Pebble seems to have staring problems according to {{CI|Sprout|name=true}}, {{CI|Rodger|name=true}}, {{CI|Toodles|name=true}}, Vee, possibly {{CI|Razzle & Dazzle}}[[Dazzle]], and {{CI|Bassie|name=true}}. The other dog Toons (Coal and {{CI|Eclipse|name=true}}) have staring problems just like he does. Similarly to real dogs, Pebble enjoys playing fetch and eating treats, maybe even a little too much, though not quite to the same extent as Coal. 

